# Build a water filter: cloudy is not the same as dissolved
#
# This is a reviewed quartz-rich play-sand teaching suspension. Natural dirty
# water can also contain clay, microbes, dissolved salts and pollutants; clear
# filtrate is not automatically safe or pure, and this simulation makes no
# drinking-water claim.
register lv1

add v1 water 100mL
add v1 quartz_sand 5g
look v1

# Filter paper retains the solid grains while water enters the receiver.
filter v1 v2
look v2

# The visible contrast and conserved quartz are computed. Paper pore size,
# natural grain-size distributions and purification beyond solids are not.
